{"title":"Photos of China&#8217;s Green Energy Transition","link":"https://kottke.org/26/01/photos-of-chinas-green-energy-transition","date":1768579698000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"4000\" height=\"2997\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1874\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1440\" height=\"960\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-04.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-04.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1500\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-05.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-05.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-05.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1500\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-06.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-06.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/images/posts/01/img-48188-06.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" /></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://e360.yale.edu/digest/china-renewable-photo-essay\">These</a> <a href=\"https://www.greenpeace.org/international/story/79654/powering-change-a-visual-journey-into-chinas-green-transition/\">photos</a> by <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/thomaschuphoto/\">Chu Weimin</a> show the mind-boggling scale of China’s green energy buildout.</p>\n\n<blockquote><p>Last year China installed more than half of all wind and solar added globally. In May alone, it added enough renewable energy to power Poland, installing solar panels at a rate of roughly 100 every second.</p>\n\n<p>The massive buildout is happening across the country, from crowded eastern cities increasingly topped by rooftop solar panels to remote western deserts where colossal wind farms sprawl across the landscape.</p></blockquote>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/China\">China</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Chu%20Weimin\">Chu Weimin</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/energy\">energy</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a></p>\n\n        \n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"20520ae7261dba3734b97c68b33670008a9615b0533b3c2d94e296d21f4a66c1","category":"Sites"}